  <reason>Subject and account: The subject Rabia Qadir holds account PK**UNIL****9281 which was opened on 3 March 2022. The subject is declared as a Student with a declared monthly income of PKR 25,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the activity window from 1 August 2026 to 10 August 2026 the account recorded 25 credits totalling PKR 1,240,000 as well as 5 debits totalling PKR 1,179,000. All credits arrived as 25 interbank (IBFT) transfers from 23 distinct senders. The activity was flagged by Tazama on 10 August 2026, with a typology score of 360 against a threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: Overall, the pattern of numerous inbound senders, rapid outflows, and activity levels far exceeding a Student’s declared income is consistent with suspected money mule activity.

Flow of funds: PKR 713,000 was sent to QuickPay wallet ***0932 (WLT****0932, Synthetic EMI) in three transactions. PKR 466,000 was withdrawn as Cash (ATM) in two transactions.

Other considerations: Screening on 28 August 2026 found no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse‑media lists.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Outgoing wallet transfers were placed on hold pending review, with no contact made with the customer about this review.</reason>
